<div class="wrap pg narrow">
  <hr class="rule" style="margin-left:0;">
  <h2><%= t('sizes.howToOrderTitle') %></h2>
  <p class="lead" style="max-width:none;">
    Ordering from Nest by Ammakkili is simple, transparent, and direct. Follow our 4-step ordering guide below.
  </p>

  <ol class="steps" style="margin-top:32px;">
    <li>
      <div>
        <b><%= t('sizes.step1Title') %></b>
        <span>Browse our catalog on our shop or watch the drape and fabric on our official YouTube channel.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <b><%= t('sizes.step2Title') %></b>
        <span>Use a measuring tape around your bust in inches and match with our Size Guide. <em>Note: Sizes cannot be changed post-order.</em></span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <b><%= t('sizes.step3Title') %></b>
        <span>Select your size, confirm stock availability, and add items to your cart.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <b><%= t('sizes.step4Title') %></b>
        <span>Complete prepaid online checkout via UPI or Card. Receive order confirmation and updates directly on WhatsApp.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top:38px; display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a class="btn" href="/shop"><%= t('nav.shop') %></a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/sizes"><%= t('nav.sizes') %></a>
  </div>
</div>

